insert_after('- do not imply authentication.\n','\nEvery HUMAN_DECISION purpose and CAPTURE_DELIVERY_INTENT declares its minimum identityAssurance in FIELD_REGISTRY. Until authentication exists, SELF_ASSERTED is the only available level and is explicitly accepted for every current purpose; every recorded decision carries its actual assurance. A purpose whose declared minimum exceeds the available assurance is BLOCKED.\n')
